OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTurning increasingly cloudy
OL,6,Fafter a dry and bright start, with a
OL,7,Ffew outbreaks of mainly light rain
OL,8,Fspreading erratically eastwards around
OL,9,Fmidday. Becoming breezy, especially
OL,10,Falong coasts, with conditions
OL,11,Fgradually improving during the
OL,12,Fafternoon. Some places staying dry
OL,13,Fthroughout.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTonight:FBreezy and mostly cloudy,
OL,16,Fwith only limited clear spells.
OL,17,FLargely dry throughout, although the
OL,18,Fodd spot of light rain cannot be ruled
OL,19,Fout. Remaining mild overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
