OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FBrightening through the
OL,6,Fmorning with widespread sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping. Largely dry throughout,
OL,8,Falthough the odd shower cannot be
OL,9,Fruled out. Remaining breezy and
OL,10,Ffeeling warm in any sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy on
OL,13,FFriday, with rain slowly clearing
OL,14,Fsoutheastwards. Dry and bright later.
OL,15,FLargely dry on Saturday, with lighter
OL,16,Fwinds. Sunny and warm Sunday, but
OL,17,Fturning wet and windy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
